2026-06-04 21:58:29,790 [INFO] evomas.models.langchain_ollama_model: [editor|resp ] ### Accessing Array Fields
2026-06-04 21:58:30,158 [INFO] evomas.models.langchain_ollama_model: [editor|resp ] ```python
